window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-022-b2830e443727c2ad.json"]={sha256:"b2830e443727c2ad6f944822112207fd5389a8eb9a5c1c8ef50c45e31db608a2",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-a2b7a3998b2023de","url":"https://www.openpolicyagent.org/docs/rest-api","title":"OPA REST API: undefined data decisions","titleEn":"OPA REST API: undefined data decisions","publisher":"Open Policy Agent","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-022","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-022","related":[{"id":"security-v27-023","referenceUrls":["https://research.google/pubs/zanzibar-googles-consistent-global-authorization-system/"],"title":"Zanzibar：撤權事件與內容讀取的一致性界線","titleEn":"Zanzibar: revocation ordering and content-read consistency","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：40%與60%可重算，空物件與字串true永不授權；報告保留傳輸成功、解析成功與決策允許三種狀態。 交付opa-response-fixtures.json、解析器真值表及未定義根因記錄；不需要部署OPA伺服器或存取正式政策。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 40 and 60 percent, never authorize empty objects or string true, and report transport, parsing and authorization as three separate states. Deliver opa-response-fixtures.json, parser truth tables and undefined-result diagnoses. No OPA server deployment or access to production policy is required.","difference":"列出授權修訂、內容修訂、檢查快照與依賴方要求的最低版本；建立先撤權後更新內容的事件圖，逐筆標出可見順序。","differenceEn":"Record authorization revision, content revision, check snapshot and the relying-party minimum revision. Draw a revoke-then-content-update timeline and mark visibility for each request, distinguishing causal ordering from wall-clock coincidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["資料API的HTTP成功與授權允許是不同層；缺result、解析錯誤、false及型別錯誤在本地契約一律不授權，但保留各自診斷原因。 10筆中4筆為布林true、3筆false、2筆缺result、1筆字串true；字串即使非空也不當成允許。 正確通過率4/10×100=40%；修正兩個缺result回應為可驗證的布林true後為6/10×100=60%。","本地模型要求檢查快照不舊於指定修訂；不足者等待或回報不可判定。等待缺口為max(0,要求版本−已見版本)，它不是時間延遲測量。 內容讀取要求至少修訂105，快取只見101；另保留修訂100的舊允許與105的撤權結果，清楚標示不能混用。 落後max(0,105−101)=4個修訂；快取推進至104後仍落後1，不能因接近而當成已符合。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Successful transport and permission are different layers. Under the local contract, missing result, parse error, false and incorrect type all withhold authorization while retaining distinct diagnostic reasons for operational repair. The ten rows contain four boolean true results, three false results, two absent results and one string containing true. A nonempty string must not gain authority through the host language truthiness rules. Correct admission is 4/10×100=40 percent. Repairing the two absent-result cases into verified boolean true responses yields 6/10×100=60 percent; the malformed string remains rejected.","The local model requires an authorization snapshot at least as new as a specified revision. An older snapshot waits or yields unavailable. Its gap is max(0,required−observed), a revision count rather than a measured time delay. A content read requires revision 105 while the cache has observed 101. Retain an old allow at revision 100 and a revocation at 105, explicitly showing that a valid old decision cannot satisfy the newer consistency requirement. The gap is max(0, 105−101)=4 revisions. Advancing the cache to 104 leaves one revision outstanding; being close does not satisfy the requested consistency boundary.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-032","referenceUrls":["https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance"],"title":"SLSA v1.2：建置類型、外部參數與解析相依綁定","titleEn":"SLSA v1.2: binding build type, external parameters and resolved dependencies","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：40%與60%可重算，空物件與字串true永不授權；報告保留傳輸成功、解析成功與決策允許三種狀態。 交付opa-response-fixtures.json、解析器真值表及未定義根因記錄；不需要部署OPA伺服器或存取正式政策。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 40 and 60 percent, never authorize empty objects or string true, and report transport, parsing and authorization as three separate states. Deliver opa-response-fixtures.json, parser truth tables and undefined-result diagnoses. No OPA server deployment or access to production policy is required.","difference":"建立12筆已驗證簽章的來源描述，列subject摘要、buildType、externalParameters及resolvedDependencies；為核准來源分支、目標與相依摘要寫明本地契約。","differenceEn":"Build 12 signature-verified provenance descriptors with subject digest, buildType, externalParameters and resolvedDependencies. Define local expectations for source revision, target and dependency digest before evaluating the records.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["資料API的HTTP成功與授權允許是不同層；缺result、解析錯誤、false及型別錯誤在本地契約一律不授權，但保留各自診斷原因。 10筆中4筆為布林true、3筆false、2筆缺result、1筆字串true；字串即使非空也不當成允許。 正確通過率4/10×100=40%；修正兩個缺result回應為可驗證的布林true後為6/10×100=60%。","v1.2規格的build provenance使用v1 predicate類型；buildType決定參數語意，未知類型不能用猜測欄位規則通過。課堂准入是本地政策，不自動授予SLSA等級。 12筆中10筆主體與builder符合，當中7筆參數及解析相依皆符合；其餘列分別標明未核准目標或相依摘要。 完整契約通過率7/12×100≈58.333%；補正兩筆已通過其他關卡的相依解析證據後為9/12×100=75%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Successful transport and permission are different layers. Under the local contract, missing result, parse error, false and incorrect type all withhold authorization while retaining distinct diagnostic reasons for operational repair. The ten rows contain four boolean true results, three false results, two absent results and one string containing true. A nonempty string must not gain authority through the host language truthiness rules. Correct admission is 4/10×100=40 percent. Repairing the two absent-result cases into verified boolean true responses yields 6/10×100=60 percent; the malformed string remains rejected.","The v1.2 build-provenance specification uses the v1 predicate type. buildType defines parameter semantics, so an unknown type cannot pass through guessed field interpretation. This consumer policy does not itself certify a SLSA level. Ten of 12 records match subject and builder, and seven of those also satisfy parameter and resolved-dependency expectations. Mark each remaining row with an unapproved target or dependency digest rather than a generic failed status. Full-contract admission is 7/12×100, approximately 58.333 percent. Correcting resolved-dependency evidence in two otherwise acceptable rows raises it to 9/12×100=75 percent, without broadening the trusted builder set.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-173a08fbfede3bc2","url":"https://research.google/pubs/zanzibar-googles-consistent-global-authorization-system/","title":"Zanzibar: Google’s Consistent, Global Authorization System","titleEn":"Zanzibar: Google’s Consistent, Global Authorization System","publisher":"Google Research / USENIX ATC 2019","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-cc97dd4df85a6cc2","url":"https://slsa.dev/spec/v1.2/build-provenance","title":"SLSA v1.2 build provenance","titleEn":"SLSA v1.2 build provenance","publisher":"SLSA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
